      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"Looking for alternatives to Envato Elements for music licensing? While Envato offers a broad range of creative assets, their music licensing terms can be restrictive—especially the limitations on \\\"on-demand\\\" services. Several specialized platforms offer better music-focused features and simpler licensing.\"",
      "context_before": null,
      "context_after": null,
