      "finding_part": 1
    },
    {
      "snippet_id": "SNP-002",
      "snippet_text": "\"For dedicated music licensing, both Artlist and Epidemic Sound offer significant advantages: clearer licensing terms, better YouTube integration, stem access (Epidemic Sound), and AI video tools (Artlist). Envato is better if you need a broad range of creative assets beyond music.\"",
